303	The `system_one` method and the `https://api.typesafe.ai/v1/systemone` endpoint are both named after [System One](/concepts/system-one), TypeSafe's AI model. [How to build with TypeSafe](/concepts/how-to-build-with-system-one) covers where to use it in your code.
